    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Eighth Sense (Arayashiki)]</p><p>You keep acting for 1 minute or until the encounter ends. You cannot drop below 1 Hit Point; you are immune to death effects and to the dying, unconscious, and paralyzed conditions; and you ignore the wounded and drained conditions.</p><p>When this ends you are dying 3 and your Cloth shatters. <strong>If the trigger killed you, you die when the minute ends.</strong> You may end it early to be merely dying 1 with an intact Cloth.</p>"
